<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Dubois did made such a a prayer, which was answered by whatever is in charge in Fifthism (likely in exchange for warping Catholicism into an appendage for the Fifth Church). It manipulated various people (like the jihadists and the ex-Cardinal) to help Dubois become Pope, but the Foundation stopped the whole affair. It's not much of a loss for the forces of Fifthism, since it's Dubois who wanted it and not them. They just took the order.</p>
<p>As for the ex-cardinal, he was shaken from the experience of being controlled and is now travelling to find out more about Fifthism.</p>
</div>
